  {system: "vLLM/SGLang/LMCache/FlashInfer/TensorRT-LLM targeted search", url: "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm", overlap: "no relevant WAL/journal recovery mechanism found in targeted searches; these are LLM serving/kernel/KV-cache systems, not durable LSM journal recovery systems"}
